1500 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: If the Archbishop really is the King of the North, he shouldn't be\back yet. If there's a good time to take a look around, this is it. Still, there\could be northern tribesmen inside, waiting for their King to return.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1510 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: We'll have to fight him sooner or later, so we should take a look. If\there's anyone inside... we'll fight them, as long as we can take them.":GOSUB 5100
