1540 GOSUB 9535:GOSUB 6150:GOSUB 5500:GOSUB 6160:BM$="The chapel was illuminated by small lights. There was a door at the other\side of the hall.":GOSUB 5100
1550 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: If the Archbishop really is the King of the North, there should be\a sorcery altar around. I doubt he'd keep it out there in public, so it's\probably in the basement.":GOSUB 5100
1560 GOSUB 6170:GOSUB 5825:BM$="They walked to the other door. It was not locked; they opened it, and\stepped inside.":GOSUB 5100
