1610 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: There might be a light switch somewhere... Then again, turning on\the lights wouldn't be very inconspicuous. It's best to use a candle.":GOSUB 5100
1620 GOSUB 6190:ISET X:BM$="They turned left at the end of the corridor. There was a door along the\wall on their right. The corridor continued on.":GOSUB 5100
