1800 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: There's papers and documents everywhere. This must be the\office. The Archbishop's quarters would be more luxurious than this.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1810 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: There might be a list of northern families somewhere. Let's take a\look.":GOSUB 5100
